#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:49
msgid "Turn off one of the CMUcam3 LEDs."
msgstr "Stäng av en av CMUcam3:s lysdioder."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:52
msgid "take_picture"
msgstr "take_picture"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:54
msgid "``take_picture()``"
msgstr "``take_picture()``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:59
msgid "Take a picture with the CMUcam3, and load the picture buffer (pixbuf)."
msgstr "Ta en bild med CMUcam3 och ladda bildbufferten (pixbuf)."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:62
msgid "print_picture"
msgstr "print_picture"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:64
msgid "``print_picture()``"
msgstr "``print_picture()``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:69
msgid ""
"Send the picture that was just taken over the serial port to be displayed in"
" the :doc:`CamScripter <camscripter>` debug window. You must call "
"take_picture prior to calling this function - it doesn't take a picture "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Skicka bilden som just togs över den seriella porten för att visas i "
"felsökningsfönstret :doc:`CamScripter <camscripter>`. Du måste anropa "
"take_picture innan du anropar denna funktion - den tar inte en bild själv."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:74
msgid "save_picture"
msgstr "save_picture"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:76
msgid "``save_picture(string filename)``"
msgstr "``save_picture(string filename)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:78
msgid "``filename`` Filename to try and save the picture under."
msgstr "``filename`` Filnamn att försöka spara bilden under."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:81
msgid ""
"Save the picture currently in the picture buffer to the passed filename. The"
" filename must be a valid FAT16 filename <8.3>, or an error will be "
"returned. If a file already exists with the given filename, it will be "
"overwritten. Note that this function does not take a picture itself - you "
"must call take_picture prior to calling save_picture."
msgstr ""
"Spara bilden som för närvarande finns i bildbufferten till det angivna "
"filnamnet. Filnamnet måste vara ett giltigt FAT16-filnamn <8.3>, annars "
"returneras ett fel. Om en fil redan finns med det angivna filnamnet skrivs "
"den över. Observera att denna funktion inte tar en bild själv - du måste "
"anropa take_picture innan du anropar save_picture."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:88
msgid "file_exists"
msgstr "file_exists"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:90
msgid "``file_exists(string filename)``"
msgstr "``file_exists(string filename)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:92
msgid "``filename``"
msgstr "``filename``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:93
msgid "boolean indicating if the file exists"
msgstr "boolean som anger om filen finns"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:95
msgid ""
"Test to see if there is a file on the MMC/SD card with the passed filename."
msgstr "Testa om det finns en fil på MMC/SD-kortet med det angivna filnamnet."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:98
msgid "camera_set_resolution"
msgstr "camera_set_resolution"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:100
msgid "``camera_set_resolution(integer resolution)``"
msgstr "``camera_set_resolution(integer resolution)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:102
msgid "``resolution`` The new resolution for the camera"
msgstr "``resolution`` Den nya upplösningen för kameran"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:105
msgid ""
"Set the resolution of the CMUcam3. Resolution must be either high or low "
"(see the Camera Resolution Constants in :doc:`luaapiconstants`)."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in upplösningen för CMUcam3. Upplösningen måste vara antingen high "
"eller low (se konstanterna för kameraupplösning i :doc:`luaapiconstants`)."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:109
msgid "camera_set_colorspace"
msgstr "camera_set_colorspace"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:111
msgid "``camera_set_colorspace(integer space)``"
msgstr "``camera_set_colorspace(integer space)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:113
msgid ""
"``space`` The new resolution for the camera, must be either "
"``CC3_COLORSPACE_YCRCB`` OR ``CC3_COLORSPACE_RGB``"
msgstr ""
"``space`` Den nya upplösningen för kameran, måste vara antingen "
"``CC3_COLORSPACE_YCRCB`` ELLER ``CC3_COLORSPACE_RGB``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:117
msgid ""
"Set the colorspace for the CMUcam3 to either YCRCB or RGB (RGB is the "
"default). See also :doc:`luaapiconstants`."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in färgrymden för CMUcam3 till antingen YCRCB eller RGB (RGB är "
"standard). Se även :doc:`luaapiconstants`."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:121
msgid "wait"
msgstr "wait"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:123
msgid "``wait(integer ms)``"
msgstr "``wait(integer ms)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:125
msgid "``ms`` The number of milliseconds to wait"
msgstr "``ms`` Antalet millisekunder att vänta"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:128
msgid "Wait for ms milliseconds."
msgstr "Vänta i ms millisekunder."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:131
msgid "pixbuf_set_coi"
msgstr "pixbuf_set_coi"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:133
msgid "``pixbuf_set_coi(integer coi)``"
msgstr "``pixbuf_set_coi(integer coi)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:137
msgid ""
"Set the channels of interest for the camera. Determines which channels the "
"camera records when taking pictures. Setting smaller values for COI can "
"speed image processing. Legal values for COI can be found in the Channel of "
"Interest Constants in :doc:`luaapiconstants`."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in kanalerna av intresse för kameran. Bestämmer vilka kanaler kameran "
"registrerar när den tar bilder. Att ställa in mindre värden för COI kan "
"snabba upp bildbearbetningen. Giltiga värden för COI finns i konstanterna "
"för kanal av intresse i :doc:`luaapiconstants`."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:143
msgid "pixbuf_read_rows"
msgstr "pixbuf_read_rows"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:145
msgid "``pixbuf_read_rows(image img, integer num_rows)``"
msgstr "``pixbuf_read_rows(image img, integer num_rows)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:147
msgid ""
"``img`` An image object into which pixbuf rows get read, ``num_rows`` The "
"number of rows to read"
msgstr ""
"``img`` Ett bildobjekt som pixbuf-rader läses in i, ``num_rows`` Antalet "
"rader att läsa"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:149
msgid "The number of rows that were successfully read"
msgstr "Antalet rader som lästes in korrekt"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:151
msgid ""
"Copy num_rows rows from the camera's picture buffer (pixbuf) into the passed"
" :doc:`image <luaapistructimage>` object."
msgstr ""
"Kopiera num_rows rader från kamerans bildbuffert (pixbuf) till det angivna "
":doc:`image <luaapistructimage>`-objektet."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:155
msgid "pixbuf_get_width"
msgstr "pixbuf_get_width"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:157
msgid "``pixbuf_get_width()``"
msgstr "``pixbuf_get_width()``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:160
msgid "The width of the pixbuf in pixels"
msgstr "Bredden på pixbuf i pixlar"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:162
msgid ""
"Get the width of the picture buffer (pixbuf). The picture buffer must have "
"been loaded before calling this by calling either take_picture or "
"show_picture."
msgstr ""
"Hämta bredden på bildbufferten (pixbuf). Bildbufferten måste ha laddats "
"innan detta anropas genom att anropa antingen take_picture eller "
"show_picture."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:166
msgid "pixbuf_get_height"
msgstr "pixbuf_get_height"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:168
msgid "``pixbuf_get_height()``"
msgstr "``pixbuf_get_height()``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:171
msgid "The height of the pixbuf in pixels"
msgstr "Höjden på pixbuf i pixlar"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:173
msgid ""
"Get the height of the picture buffer (pixbuf). The picture buffer must have "
"been loaded before calling this by calling either take_picture or "
"show_picture."
msgstr ""
"Hämta höjden på bildbufferten (pixbuf). Bildbufferten måste ha laddats innan"
" detta anropas genom att anropa antingen take_picture eller show_picture."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:177
msgid "pixel_new"
msgstr "pixel_new"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:179
msgid "``pixel_new()``"
msgstr "``pixel_new()``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:182
msgid "A new :doc:`pixel <luaapistructpixel>` data structure"
msgstr "En ny :doc:`pixel <luaapistructpixel>`-datastruktur"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:184
msgid ""
"Creates and returns a new pixel data structure. See the :doc:`pixel "
"documentation <luaapistructpixel>` for details about the structure. See also"
" ``pixbuf_get_pixel`` and ``get_pixel`` for usage of the :doc:`pixel "
"<luaapistructpixel>` structure."
msgstr ""
"Skapar och returnerar en ny pixeldatastruktur. Se :doc:`pixel-"
"dokumentationen <luaapistructpixel>` för detaljer om strukturen. Se även "
"``pixbuf_get_pixel`` och ``get_pixel`` för användning av :doc:`pixel "
"<luaapistructpixel>`-strukturen."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:190
msgid "get_pixel"
msgstr "get_pixel"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:192
msgid "``get_pixel(pixel pxl, integer x, integer y)``"
msgstr "``get_pixel(pixel pxl, integer x, integer y)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:194
msgid ""
"``pxl`` The :doc:`pixel <luaapistructpixel>` data structure into which to "
"store the pixel values. ``x``, ``y`` The x and y coordinates of the pixel to"
" retrieve within the picture buffer."
msgstr ""
"``pxl`` :doc:`pixel <luaapistructpixel>`-datastrukturen som pixelvärdena ska"
" lagras i. ``x``, ``y`` x- och y-koordinaterna för pixeln som ska hämtas i "
"bildbufferten."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:197
msgid ""
"none, the pixel values are stored in the passed in :doc:`pixel "
"<luaapistructpixel>`"
msgstr ""
"ingen, pixelvärdena lagras i den angivna :doc:`pixel <luaapistructpixel>`"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:200
msgid ""
"Get a single :doc:`pixel <luaapistructpixel>` from within the CMUcam3 "
"picture buffer (pixbuf). x and y must be less than ``pixbuf_get_width`` and "
"``pixbuf_get_height``, respectively. If ``take_picture`` hasn't been called "
"to store a picture in the pixbuf this function will not fail, but the values"
" inserted into the :doc:`pixel <luaapistructpixel>` will be garbage."
msgstr ""
"Hämta en enda :doc:`pixel <luaapistructpixel>` från CMUcam3:s bildbuffert "
"(pixbuf). x och y måste vara mindre än ``pixbuf_get_width`` respektive "
"``pixbuf_get_height``. Om ``take_picture`` inte har anropats för att lagra "
"en bild i pixbuf misslyckas denna funktion inte, men värdena som infogas i "
":doc:`pixel <luaapistructpixel>` blir skräp."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:207
msgid "image_new"
msgstr "image_new"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:209
msgid "``image_new(integer width, integer height)``"
msgstr "``image_new(integer width, integer height)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:211
msgid "``width`` The width of the image, ``height`` The image height"
msgstr "``width`` Bildens bredd, ``height`` Bildens höjd"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:212
msgid "A new :doc:`image <luaapistructimage>` data structure."
msgstr "En ny :doc:`image <luaapistructimage>`-datastruktur."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:214
msgid ""
"Get a new :doc:`image <luaapistructimage>` data structure, with the passed-"
"in width, height and pixsize. See the :doc:`image <luaapistructimage>` "
"documentation for more information about using :doc:`image "
"<luaapistructimage>` data structures."
msgstr ""
"Hämta en ny :doc:`image <luaapistructimage>`-datastruktur, med den angivna "
"bredden, höjden och pixsize. Se :doc:`image "
"<luaapistructimage>`-dokumentationen för mer information om hur du använder "
":doc:`image <luaapistructimage>`-datastrukturer."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:218
msgid ""
"Get a :doc:`pixel <luaapistructpixel>` from the passed-in :doc:`image "
"<luaapistructimage>` data structure. The pixel's RGB values will be stored "
"into the passed in :doc:`pixel <luaapistructpixel>` data structure. The "
"parameter x must be less than the :doc:`image <luaapistructimage>`'s width, "
"and y must be less than the :doc:`image <luaapistructimage>`'s height."
msgstr ""
"Hämta en :doc:`pixel <luaapistructpixel>` från den angivna datastrukturen "
":doc:`image <luaapistructimage>`. Pixelns RGB-värden lagras i den angivna "
"datastrukturen :doc:`pixel <luaapistructpixel>`. Parametern x måste vara "
"mindre än bredden på :doc:`image <luaapistructimage>`, och y måste vara "
"mindre än höjden på :doc:`image <luaapistructimage>`."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:225
msgid "framediff_new"
msgstr "framediff_new"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:227
msgid "``framediff_new(integer template_width, integer template_height)``"
msgstr "``framediff_new(integer template_width, integer template_height)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:229
msgid ""
"``template_width`` The width of the template we're diffing, "
"``template_height`` The height of the template"
msgstr ""
"``template_width`` Bredden på mallen vi jämför, ``template_height`` Höjden "
"på mallen"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:231
msgid "A new :doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>` data structure"
msgstr "En ny :doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>`-datastruktur"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:233
msgid ""
"Get a new :doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>` data structure, with the "
"passed in template width and height. See the :doc:`framediff "
"<luaapistructframediff>` structures are generally used for evaluating the "
"difference between two picture frames taken with the CMUcam3, but see the "
":doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>` documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Hämta en ny :doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>`-datastruktur, med den "
"angivna mallbredden och -höjden. :doc:`framediff "
"<luaapistructframediff>`-strukturer används i allmänhet för att utvärdera "
"skillnaden mellan två bildrutor tagna med CMUcam3, men se :doc:`framediff "
"<luaapistructframediff>`-dokumentationen för mer information."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:241
msgid "framediff_scanline_start"
msgstr "framediff_scanline_start"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:243
msgid "``framediff_scanline_start(framediff fd)``"
msgstr "``framediff_scanline_start(framediff fd)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:245
msgid "``fd`` The :doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>` object to use"
msgstr "``fd`` :doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>`-objektet att använda"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:246
msgid "Returns 1 if successful."
msgstr "Returnerar 1 om det lyckas."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:248
msgid ""
"Initializes everything needed to do frame differencing using "
"``framediff_scanline``. Makes sure there is a current_template set in the "
":doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>` structure (or loads current "
"template if ``framediff:get_load_frame()`` is true)."
msgstr ""
"Initierar allt som behövs för att göra bildskillnadsberäkning med "
"``framediff_scanline``. Säkerställer att det finns en current_template "
"inställd i :doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>`-strukturen (eller laddar"
" den aktuella mallen om ``framediff:get_load_frame()`` är sant)."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:254
msgid "framediff_scanline"
msgstr "framediff_scanline"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:256
msgid "``framediff_scanline(image img, framediff fd)``"
msgstr "``framediff_scanline(image img, framediff fd)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:258
msgid ""
"``img`` An :doc:`image <luaapistructimage>` data structure, ``fd`` A "
":doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>` data structure"
msgstr ""
"``img`` En :doc:`image <luaapistructimage>`-datastruktur, ``fd`` En "
":doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>`-datastruktur"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:260
msgid "Returns 1 if successful"
msgstr "Returnerar 1 om det lyckas"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:262
msgid ""
"Gets all the pixels from img and loads them into the proper slot in the "
":doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>` structure, so that the two "
"templates (current_template and previous_template) can be compared. If "
"fd:get_load_frame is true, will load the pixels in img into the previous "
"template slot. If fd:get_load_frame is false, loads the pixels from img into"
" the current_template."
msgstr ""
"Hämtar alla pixlar från img och laddar dem i rätt plats i :doc:`framediff "
"<luaapistructframediff>`-strukturen, så att de två mallarna "
"(current_template och previous_template) kan jämföras. Om fd:get_load_frame "
"är sant laddas pixlarna i img in i platsen för den föregående mallen. Om "
"fd:get_load_frame är falskt laddas pixlarna från img in i current_template."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:269
msgid "framediff_scanline_finish"
msgstr "framediff_scanline_finish"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:271
msgid "``framediff_scanline_finish(framediff fd)``"
msgstr "``framediff_scanline_finish(framediff fd)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:273
msgid ""
"``fd`` The :doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>` data structure to use"
msgstr ""
"``fd`` :doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>`-datastrukturen att använda"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:275
msgid "Returns 1 if the operation was successful."
msgstr "Returnerar 1 om operationen lyckades."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:277
msgid ""
"Compares the two templates (current_template and previous_template) in the "
":doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>` data structure, and computes the "
"number of pixels that are different, storing that value in :doc:`framediff "
"<luaapistructframediff>`:get_num_pixels."
msgstr ""
"Jämför de två mallarna (current_template och previous_template) i "
"datastrukturen :doc:`framediff <luaapistructframediff>` och beräknar antalet"
" pixlar som skiljer sig åt, och lagrar det värdet i :doc:`framediff "
"<luaapistructframediff>`:get_num_pixels."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:283
msgid "print_color_tracker"
msgstr "print_color_tracker"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:285
msgid "``print_color_tracker(tracker tracker)``"
msgstr "``print_color_tracker(tracker tracker)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:287
msgid ""
"``tracker`` The :doc:`tracker <luaapistructtracker>` provides the data used "
"to print"
msgstr ""
"``tracker`` :doc:`tracker <luaapistructtracker>` tillhandahåller datan som "
"används för utskrift"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:291
msgid ""
"Uses the data in the :doc:`tracker <luaapistructtracker>` object to print "
"out debugging information on the CamScripter. Prints a rectangle "
"representing the picture in the camera picture buffer, with another "
"rectangle inside it representing the bounding box for the color being "
"tracked, and a red dot showing the centroid of the color within the picture."
msgstr ""
"Använder datan i :doc:`tracker <luaapistructtracker>`-objektet för att "
"skriva ut felsökningsinformation på CamScripter. Skriver ut en rektangel som"
" representerar bilden i kamerans bildbuffert, med en annan rektangel inuti "
"som representerar begränsningsrutan för den färg som spåras, och en röd "
"prick som visar färgens tyngdpunkt i bilden."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:298
msgid "print_rectangle"
msgstr "print_rectangle"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:300
msgid ""
"``print_rectangle(integer x, integer y, integer width, integer height [, "
"integer red, integer green, integer blue])``"
msgstr ""
"``print_rectangle(integer x, integer y, integer width, integer height [, "
"integer red, integer green, integer blue])``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:302
msgid ""
"``x``, ``y`` is the coordinate location of the upper left corner of the "
"rectangle in distance from the upper left corner of the graphics screen. "
"``width`` and ``height`` are the width and height of the rectangle. The "
"optional ``red``, ``green``, and ``blue`` arguments give the color the "
"rectangle will be drawn in as an RGB value. The default color is black."
msgstr ""
"``x``, ``y`` är koordinatplatsen för rektangelns övre vänstra hörn räknat "
"som avstånd från grafikskärmens övre vänstra hörn. ``width`` och ``height`` "
"är rektangelns bredd och höjd. De valfria argumenten ``red``, ``green`` och "
"``blue`` anger färgen som rektangeln ritas i som ett RGB-värde. "
"Standardfärgen är svart."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:309
msgid ""
"Draws a rectangle width pixels wide and height pixels tall in the "
"CamScripter graphics tab. Optional red, green, and blue arguments allow for "
"changing the color of the rectangle using RGB values between 0 and 255."
msgstr ""
"Ritar en rektangel som är width pixlar bred och height pixlar hög i "
"CamScripters grafikflik. Valfria argument för rött, grönt och blått gör att "
"rektangelns färg kan ändras med RGB-värden mellan 0 och 255."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:314
msgid "print_line"
msgstr "print_line"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:316
msgid ""
"``print_line(integer start_x, integer start_y, integer end_x, integer end_y "
"[, integer red, integer green, integer blue])``"
msgstr ""
"``print_line(integer start_x, integer start_y, integer end_x, integer end_y "
"[, integer red, integer green, integer blue])``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:318
msgid ""
"The starting point and the ending point for the line, and optional arguments"
" to set the color of the line."
msgstr ""
"Startpunkten och slutpunkten för linjen, och valfria argument för att ställa"
" in linjens färg."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:322
msgid ""
"Draw a line on the CamScripter graphics screen from (start_x, start_y) to "
"(end_x, end_y). The RGB color of the line can be specified with optional "
"red, green, and blue arguments. The default color is black, if no color is "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"Rita en linje på CamScripters grafikskärm från (start_x, start_y) till "
"(end_x, end_y). Linjens RGB-färg kan anges med valfria argument för rött, "
"grönt och blått. Standardfärgen är svart om ingen färg anges."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:327
msgid "print_oval"
msgstr "print_oval"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:329
msgid ""
"``print_oval(integer x, integer y, integer width, integer height [, integer "
"red, intger green, integer blue])``"
msgstr ""
"``print_oval(integer x, integer y, integer width, integer height [, integer "
"red, intger green, integer blue])``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:331
msgid ""
"The upper left hand corner of the oval is specified by (x, y). Width and "
"height are in pixels. Red, green, and blue are optional arguments to set the"
" color of the oval."
msgstr ""
"Ovalens övre vänstra hörn anges av (x, y). Bredd och höjd är i pixlar. Red, "
"green och blue är valfria argument för att ställa in ovalens färg."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst
msgid "Return values"
msgstr "Returvärden"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:336
msgid ""
"Draw an oval on the CamScripter graphics screen. The oval's upper left hand "
"corner is at the point (x, y). The RGB color of the oval can be specified "
"with optional red, green, and blue arguments. The default color is black, if"
" no color is specified."
msgstr ""
"Rita en oval på CamScripters grafikskärm. Ovalens övre vänstra hörn är i "
"punkten (x, y). Ovalens RGB-färg kan anges med valfria argument för rött, "
"grönt och blått. Standardfärgen är svart om ingen färg anges."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:342
msgid "clear_graphics"
msgstr "clear_graphics"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:344
msgid "``clear_graphics()``"
msgstr "``clear_graphics()``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:349
msgid "Clear the CamScripter graphics screen."
msgstr "Rensa CamScripters grafikskärm."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:352
msgid "tracker_track_color"
msgstr "tracker_track_color"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:354
msgid "``tracker_track_color(tracker theTracker)``"
msgstr "``tracker_track_color(tracker theTracker)``"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:356
msgid ""
"the :doc:`tracker <luaapistructtracker>` object used to do the color "
"tracking, set with the desired RGB value to set."
msgstr ""
"objektet :doc:`tracker <luaapistructtracker>` som används för att utföra "
"färgspårningen, satt med önskat RGB-värde som ska ställas in."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:358
msgid ""
"boolean indicating if the tracking was able to happen. Returns true even if "
"the color wasn't found -- only returns false if an error occurred."
msgstr ""
"boolean som anger om spårningen kunde ske. Returnerar true även om färgen "
"inte hittades -- returnerar endast false om ett fel uppstod."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapifunctions.rst:362
msgid ""
"Track a color in the CMUcam3 using the passed-in :doc:`tracker "
"<luaapistructtracker>` object. ``take_picture()`` must be called before "
"trying to track a color. Analyzes the picture buffer, and sets values in the"
" :doc:`tracker <luaapistructtracker>` object to give a bounding box for teh "
"color and an (x, y) value representing the centroid of the color. See "
":doc:`the tracker documentation <luaapistructtracker>` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Spåra en färg i CMUcam3 med hjälp av det angivna :doc:`tracker "
"<luaapistructtracker>`-objektet. ``take_picture()`` måste anropas innan du "
"försöker spåra en färg. Analyserar bildbufferten och ställer in värden i "
":doc:`tracker <luaapistructtracker>`-objektet för att ge en begränsningsruta"
" för färgen och ett (x, y)-värde som representerar färgens tyngdpunkt. Se "
":doc:`tracker-dokumentationen <luaapistructtracker>` för mer information."
